abstract: >-
  Machine-checked core of the Chinukwe Formalism: reference-shifted coupled hazard model,
  proportional domain weights, coupled critical-distance fixed point, and cascade-stability
  thresholds (discrete and continuous time), verified against Mathlib with an automated
  axiom audit.
